      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "10d7fa59-93d6-4e08-b4ca-bceebf2000dd"],
     " of them for a family of alternatives (the DAGs of a line or a ray, the \
atoms of a circle) or for the pieces of a polyline"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"f934c1ed-ed35-405d-abe8-69f945ac7fce"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "27f9596c-48de-44bc-8098-93435a9ab1e8"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Cardinality\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
